  "name": "Ontario Public-Sector Jobs Snapshot, November 2026",
  "description": "Aggregate statistics on 3,497 open public-sector job postings from 155 employers tracked by PublicJobs.ca, mostly in the Greater Toronto Area, as of November 19, 2026: counts by sector, employer and region, posted-salary statistics (share with salary, median, share paying $100K+), employment type, work mode and closing dates.",
